    "title": "Cowgirls Season Comes to and End at #1 Wellington - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Trent Sanchez ,\n1 days ago WELLINGTON: The Wellington advanced to a Sub-State final Tuesday night but it wasn’t easy early on against a scrappy Abilene Cowgirl team. Abilene led 11-9 at the end of the 1st quarter but then struggled to score for nearly two quarters. The Cowgirls scored with 3:17 to play in the opening quarter and wouldn’t score again until 4:24 to play in the 3rd. Wellington during that stretch went on a 23-0 run to take control of the game. The Lady Crusaders led by as many as 25 points in the final quarter. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
